&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future with Us — EquipmentShare is Hiring a Small Engine Shop Technician (Mechanic)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EquipmentShare, we’re not just filling a role —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;we’re assembling the best team on the planet to build something that’s never been built before&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re on a mission to transform an industry that’s been stuck in the past by empowering contractors and communities through innovative technology, real-time support, and a team that truly cares.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Small Engine&amp;nbsp;Shop Technician (Mechanic)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at our retail facility in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Waxahachie, TX&lt;/strong&gt;, and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, provide maintenance and repair for a variety of customer owned small engine machinery. Mechanics will have the opportunity to work on the newest fleet in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
