&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;deep partnerships with key stakeholders (CMOs, VPs of Marketing, Creative Directors, Brand Managers) by&amp;nbsp;demonstrating&amp;nbsp;profound knowledge of AI-powered content solutions tailored to their business goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
